-- block at the end of WeaponController that wraps _ReloadClip / _PlayShell: the rounds left pick <Prefix>Reload_<Variant> (the
-- shotgun: Start_Dry, Shell_Port / _B / _Last), played in the base clip's slot (so cancels, the left hand and a shot cutting a
-- shell all work as before) and fitted to the gun's ReloadTime exactly as before. The server is not touched.
